- You always put stones in the locks. - No!

01:26:39.990 --> 01:26:46.510
Give me the other one. Give me that hand!

01:26:46.510 --> 01:26:53.130
It doesn't close! You lost them, so drag yourself!

01:26:53.130 --> 01:26:59.480
Drag yourself! Drag yourself, I tell you!

01:27:05.180 --> 01:27:09.160
- I can't go. I can't! - Get out of here!

01:27:39.500 --> 01:27:42.730
Al roso mi tambor!

01:27:42.730 --> 01:27:50.040
tambor!

01:27:50.040 --> 01:27:54.450
al roso mi tambor!

01:27:54.450 --> 01:27:57.390
no me vayas a pegar!

01:27:57.390 --> 01:28:00.000
no me vayas a mandar!

01:28:03.740 --> 01:28:17.960
No, no, no, Bando!

01:29:37.870 --> 01:29:43.120
Once you reach TAR, you'll have a liquid gold crown on your forehead

01:29:43.120 --> 01:29:48.530
and you'll possess the key to all the labyrinths.

01:33:34.410 --> 01:33:41.140
I will remember you and I will go to see you at the cemetery with a flower and a dog.

01:33:41.140 --> 01:33:47.960
And at your funeral I will sing in low voice the refrain that says:

01:33:47.960 --> 01:33:56.920
"How beautiful is a burial, how beautiful is a burial."

01:34:04.920 --> 01:34:07.170
I will do it for you, Liz.

01:34:33.800 --> 01:34:35.480
I've found my love.
